{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An unfamiliar and mysterious world. Drowned Lake takes inspiration from Brazilian folklore, exploring themes of religious syncretism and social discontent, all wrapped in a chilling documentary found footage horror experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/830fa4b73c4d0b2ef83bfcf0560c47b2.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/830fa4b73c4d0b2ef83bfcf0560c47b2.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/830fa4b73c4d0b2ef83bfcf0560c47b2.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Carolina the reporter, Rafael the first responder, or Leonardo the old fisherman. What begins as a rescue mission quickly spirals into a series of bizarre and disturbing events. As the lake\u2019s dark past comes to light, so do the secrets buried deep within the strangers, forcing them to confront both their inner demons and the sinister presence haunting the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/66b6b58b58fdb04f77a6b441cb032ce6.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/66b6b58b58fdb04f77a6b441cb032ce6.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/66b6b58b58fdb04f77a6b441cb032ce6.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Lady Calls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the lake as one of three different characters. Each has their own secrets, motivations, and desires. Our lady whispers sweet promises. Who will answer?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/f9a68037fe5e24c2c860990bbbd3c1c1.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/f9a68037fe5e24c2c860990bbbd3c1c1.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/f9a68037fe5e24c2c860990bbbd3c1c1.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Oppressive and Immersive Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From abandoned wrecks or to quiet streams, a dark presence pervades every inch of the lake. Safety is a dream. It's time to wake up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/3db6455c43312097f280907c5a104054.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/3db6455c43312097f280907c5a104054.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/3db6455c43312097f280907c5a104054.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing with consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what the lake waters may bring... or what they will demand of you. Will you reel in your salvation, or awaken up the terrors below?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/bfd763d9fe3479b203008601620483b3.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/bfd763d9fe3479b203008601620483b3.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/bfd763d9fe3479b203008601620483b3.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Documented Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the terror in a unique blend of first person and isometric view. Recover the tapes, piece together the story, and continue Bento's work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/1f60d87e8e169540295b247a9fd89ab7.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/1f60d87e8e169540295b247a9fd89ab7.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/1f60d87e8e169540295b247a9fd89ab7.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Breed of Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowned Lake Draws from Brazil\u2019s rich folklore, blending local myths, cryptic creatures, and real history into a unique horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery. Find the source. Answer the Lady's call. Survive or be consumed... by The Drowned Lake.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2601540?t=1771578453","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2601540?t=1771578453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771578453","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771578453","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An unfamiliar and mysterious world. Drowned Lake takes inspiration from Brazilian folklore, exploring themes of religious syncretism and social discontent, all wrapped in a chilling documentary found footage horror experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/830fa4b73c4d0b2ef83bfcf0560c47b2.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/830fa4b73c4d0b2ef83bfcf0560c47b2.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/830fa4b73c4d0b2ef83bfcf0560c47b2.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Carolina the reporter, Rafael the first responder, or Leonardo the old fisherman. What begins as a rescue mission quickly spirals into a series of bizarre and disturbing events. As the lake\u2019s dark past comes to light, so do the secrets buried deep within the strangers, forcing them to confront both their inner demons and the sinister presence haunting the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/66b6b58b58fdb04f77a6b441cb032ce6.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/66b6b58b58fdb04f77a6b441cb032ce6.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/66b6b58b58fdb04f77a6b441cb032ce6.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Lady Calls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the lake as one of three different characters. Each has their own secrets, motivations, and desires. Our lady whispers sweet promises. Who will answer?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/f9a68037fe5e24c2c860990bbbd3c1c1.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/f9a68037fe5e24c2c860990bbbd3c1c1.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/f9a68037fe5e24c2c860990bbbd3c1c1.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Oppressive and Immersive Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From abandoned wrecks or to quiet streams, a dark presence pervades every inch of the lake. Safety is a dream. It's time to wake up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/3db6455c43312097f280907c5a104054.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/3db6455c43312097f280907c5a104054.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/3db6455c43312097f280907c5a104054.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing with consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what the lake waters may bring... or what they will demand of you. Will you reel in your salvation, or awaken up the terrors below?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/bfd763d9fe3479b203008601620483b3.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/bfd763d9fe3479b203008601620483b3.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/bfd763d9fe3479b203008601620483b3.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Documented Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the terror in a unique blend of first person and isometric view. Recover the tapes, piece together the story, and continue Bento's work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/1f60d87e8e169540295b247a9fd89ab7.poster.avif?t=1771578453\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/1f60d87e8e169540295b247a9fd89ab7.webm?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/extras/1f60d87e8e169540295b247a9fd89ab7.mp4?t=1771578453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Breed of Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowned Lake Draws from Brazil\u2019s rich folklore, blending local myths, cryptic creatures, and real history into a unique horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery. Find the source. Answer the Lady's call. Survive or be consumed... by The Drowned Lake.</p>","developers":["Monumental Collab"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601540/header.jpg?t=1771578453","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2601540/1287975950/9bcd867e7f2e244fa4e6d8b3a620e67c109a5280/1763841928/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763842760","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2601540/1287975950/9bcd867e7f2e244fa4e6d8b3a620e67c109a5280/1763841928/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763842760","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2601540/1287975950/9bcd867e7f2e244fa4e6d8b3a620e67c109a5280/1763841928/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763842760","id":256985391,"name":"Playtest Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256985391/92f7ef8c26a383f515ca4a46a2b6bbf094244d9d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763842760"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2601540/913450872/534cf5d4cc45db97ff1ea568875fa8938f9fbda9/1758200682/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758210837","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2601540/913450872/534cf5d4cc45db97ff1ea568875fa8938f9fbda9/1758200682/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758210837","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2601